# Kevin is asked for review on every PR. Approval is optional on purpose (two developers, decided 16 Nov 2026):
# the ruleset does not require it. CODEOWNERS makes GitHub request Kevin's review; the Rights workflow
# (.github/workflows/rights.yml) labels and comments on rights changes.
# GitHub reads the LAST matching line, so keep the catch-all first and put more specific rules below it.
# The app lives in apps/app (npm workspaces): paths are from the repo root.
*                                         @selluxhenner

